## POST /api/enquiry

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant D1
    participant Resend

    C->>H: POST { name, email, dob?, phone? }
    H->>H: validateEnquiryData()
    H->>D1: getEnquiryByEmail() — duplicate check
    H->>D1: insertEnquiry()
    H->>D1: resolveAgeGroup()
    alt Academy path
        H->>D1: addToWaitlist()
        H->>Resend: sendAcademyWaitlist()
    else Taster path
        H->>D1: createInviteForEnquiry()
        H->>Resend: sendBookingInvite()
    end
    H->>D1: appendEnquiryEvent()
    H-->>C: 201 { enquiry_id, path }
```

> Email send failures are caught and logged — they **never** fail the enquiry creation.

## POST /api/booking

Requires a valid invite token (`status = 'sent'`).

| Status | Condition |
|---|---|
| `200` | Booking created |
| `404` | Token not found |
| `409` | Invite accepted / slot full / duplicate |
| `410` | Invite expired |
| `422` | Missing date or age group mismatch |

## GET /api/health

```mermaid
graph LR
    H[GET /api/health] --> D1[D1: SELECT 1]
    H --> KV[KV: put+get test key]
    H --> Em[RESEND_API_KEY set?]
    D1 -->|fail| S503[503 DB_UNAVAILABLE]
    D1 -->|pass| Agg[Aggregate]
    KV & Em --> Agg
    Agg -->|all pass| SOK[200 status: ok]
    Agg -->|partial| SDeg[200 status: degraded]
```

## Error shape

All errors use:
```json
{ "ok": false, "error": "Message", "code": "MACHINE_CODE" }
```

| Error class | Status | Code |
|---|---|---|
| `ValidationError` | 400 | `VALIDATION_ERROR` |
| `AuthError` | 401 | `UNAUTHORIZED` |
| `NotFoundError` | 404 | `NOT_FOUND` |
| `ConflictError` | 409 | `CONFLICT` |
| `RateLimitError` | 429 | `RATE_LIMITED` + `Retry-After` header |
| Unknown | 500 | `INTERNAL_ERROR` (original hidden) |

